cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "The figures belong to the cited papers. Cite those when the number matters; cite this repository only for the CSV curve or the percentile code."
title: "Typing speed benchmarks with sources"
abstract: >-
  Typing-speed figures with primary sources: mean 51.56 WPM on a desktop keyboard
  (Dhakal et al., CHI 2018, n=168,960), 36.17 WPM on a phone (Palin et al.,
  MobileHCI 2019, n=37,370), a derived percentile curve, unit conversions and
  advertised job bands.
authors:
  - name: "Typing.Rerivo"
    website: "https://typing.rerivo.com/typing-speed-benchmarks.html"
repository-code: "https://github.com/hello532/typing-speed-benchmarks"
url: "https://typing.rerivo.com/typing-speed-benchmarks.html"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - typing speed
  - words per minute
  - benchmark
  - percentile
preferred-citation:
  type: dataset
  title: "Typing speed benchmarks: percentile curve and unit conversions"
  authors:
    - name: "Typing.Rerivo"
  year: 2026
  url: "https://typing.rerivo.com/typing-speed-benchmarks.html"
